        <div class="tb" id="tb_1" data-block-id="subhead"
          style="position:absolute;left:50%;top:25.2%;width:88%;transform:translate(-50%,0);text-align:center;font-size:3.8cqmin;color:#e6d3ae;font-weight:400;font-family:'Inter', -apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.18;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:break-word">
          You've earned your <span style="font-weight:800">FREE Printable</span> Chair Tai Chi PDF Guide for beginners!
